        {
          "text": "Ne bulaano OMWAMI yaboolile ari Emiyika nichishilo okhubira chitaru, shinga emiyika chiomukholi womushaara, oluyali iwaMoabu lulaiwolwa kata olwa abandube bali abanji; nomusikalo kulaba omutuutu muno, okurapaarwakhwo ta.",
